          "benefits_md": "\n- **Quantum of Assistance:** Subsidy for Minikits.\n<br>\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The \"Distribution of Minikits at Free of Cost\" scheme provides subsidies for minikits to maize-growing farmers in some of the selected districts of Tamil Nadu.\n\n",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The “Distribution of Minikits at Free of Cost” scheme by the Agriculture-Farmers Welfare Department, Tamil Nadu, provides subsidies for minikits to maize-growing farmers in specific districts including Coimbatore, Dindigul, Erode, Dharmapuri, Krishnagiri, Namakkal, Perambalur, Virudhunagar, Theni, Villupuram, Vellore, Salem, Pudukkottai, Madurai, Sivagangai, Trichy, Tirunelveli, and Thoothukudi."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The “Distribution of Minikits at Free of Cost” scheme by the Agriculture-Farmers Welfare Department, Tamil Nadu, provides subsidies for minikits to maize-growing farmers in specific districts including Coimbatore, Dindigul, Erode, Dharmapuri, Krishnagiri, Namakkal, Perambalur, Virudhunagar, Theni, Villupuram, Vellore, Salem, Pudukkottai, Madurai, Sivagangai, Trichy, Tirunelveli, and Thoothukudi.\n",
